00:00:20.148 --> 00:00:21.455
13 SERVICEMEN WERE KILLED

00:00:21.466 --> 00:00:22.946
YESTERDAY IN A BOMBING OUTSIDE

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:24.637
THE KABUL AIRPORT.

00:00:24.648 --> 00:00:27.099
ONE OF THEM WAS A U.S. MARINE

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:27.802
CALLED KAREEM.

00:00:27.836 --> 00:00:29.807
THIS VIDEO FROM AFGHANISTAN

00:00:29.808 --> 00:00:31.831
COULD BE THE LAST TAKEN OF HIM

00:00:31.832 --> 00:00:33.757
BEFORE HIS DEATH.

00:00:33.768 --> 00:00:35.770
&gt;&gt; SAY HI TO THE CAMERA.

00:00:35.803 --> 00:00:39.039
HI.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:41.721
&gt;&gt; HI.

00:00:41.732 --> 00:00:43.768
WE FRIENDS?

00:00:43.769 --> 00:00:47.056
FRIENDS?

00:00:47.067 --> 00:00:48.334
FRIEND?

00:00:48.345 --> 00:00:50.428
YEAH?

00:00:50.439 --> 00:00:51.915
FRIEND.

00:00:51.949 --> 00:00:52.683
FRIEND.

00:00:52.684 --> 00:00:55.454
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HIS FATHER IS STEVE

00:00:55.465 --> 00:00:57.260
AND HE JOINS US TONIGHT.

00:00:57.295 --> 00:00:59.472
I APPRECIATE YOU COMING ON.

00:00:59.473 --> 00:01:00.991
OUR HEARTS BREAK FOR YOU.

00:01:00.992 --> 00:01:01.473
I’M SORRY.

00:01:01.484 --> 00:01:02.330
SO --

00:01:02.341 --> 00:01:03.459
&gt;&gt; THANK YOU, TUCKER.

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:05.590
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT’S HARD TO KNOW

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:09.098
WHAT TO ASK YOU OTHER THAN TO

00:01:09.109 --> 00:01:10.776
EXTEND OUR SINCERE FOR-REAL

00:01:10.787 --> 00:01:12.291
HEART-FELT SYMPATHIES.

00:01:12.302 --> 00:01:14.677
HOW ARE YOU DOING 24 HOURS

00:01:14.678 --> 00:01:15.173
LATER?

00:01:15.175 --> 00:01:18.645
&gt;&gt; WELL, I’M GOING ON ABOUT 36

00:01:18.656 --> 00:01:20.269
HOURS, I BELIEVE, THAT I’VE BEEN

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:20.882
UP.

00:01:20.893 --> 00:01:23.933
I STILL IN SHOCK.

00:01:23.966 --> 00:01:27.246
THE FAMILY IS DEVASTATED.

00:01:27.257 --> 00:01:31.270
HIS MOTHER, WHO IS AN EXCELLENT

00:01:31.281 --> 00:01:35.213
MOM, YOU KNOW, IS DOING THE BEST

00:01:35.224 --> 00:01:36.887
THAT SHE CAN CONSIDERING THE

00:01:36.898 --> 00:01:37.141
CIRCUMSTANCES.

00:01:37.152 --> 00:01:38.497
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YEAH.

00:01:38.531 --> 00:01:40.881
SO THE REASON THAT WE WANTED TO

00:01:40.892 --> 00:01:42.891
TALK TO YOU, JUST TO REMIND

00:01:42.902 --> 00:01:45.600
EVERYBODY WATCHING AND PEOPLE

00:01:45.611 --> 00:01:48.504
KNOW THIS, THESE ARE REAL PEOPLE

00:01:48.538 --> 00:01:50.044
SERVING OUR COUNTRY AND DYING

00:01:50.055 --> 00:01:52.462
BECAUSE THEY’VE BEEN ASKED TO

00:01:52.473 --> 00:01:53.979
PUT THEIR LIVES AT RISK.

00:01:54.013 --> 00:01:55.879
SO WERE YOU CONCERNED YOUR BOY

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:58.417
IS OVER THERE IN THE FINAL DAYS

00:01:58.451 --> 00:01:59.546
OF OUR OCCUPATION, WERE YOU

00:01:59.557 --> 00:02:01.096
WORRIED FOR HIM?

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:03.298
&gt;&gt; OH, YEAH, DEFINITELY.

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:08.396
HE HAD VOICED SOME WORRY, TOO,
TO THE FAMILY EARLIER, PRIOR TO

00:02:08.397 --> 00:02:12.150
TO THE FAMILY EARLIER, PRIOR TO

00:02:12.151 --> 00:02:14.642
HIM GOING.

00:02:14.653 --> 00:02:18.919
LOOKED AT THE WAY THAT THE

00:02:18.953 --> 00:02:21.531
TALIBAN HAD, YOU KNOW,

00:02:21.533 --> 00:02:24.178
INFILTRATED THE WHOLE COUNTRY SO

00:02:24.189 --> 00:02:26.997
FAST AND WE WERE JUST KIND OF

00:02:27.008 --> 00:02:28.606
LEFT TO THIS ONE LITTLE AIRPORT

00:02:28.617 --> 00:02:29.657
CONCERNED ME.

00:02:29.691 --> 00:02:32.800
THE VIDEOS THAT WE WERE GETTING

00:02:32.801 --> 00:02:35.382
AND THE PICTURES THAT WE WERE

00:02:35.383 --> 00:02:36.653
GETTING FROM HIM LOOKED SOMEWHAT

00:02:36.664 --> 00:02:37.149
CHAOTIC.

00:02:37.160 --> 00:02:39.741
WE GOT THE VIDEO THAT YOU HAD

00:02:39.752 --> 00:02:41.680
JUST PLAYED AND WE GOT OTHER

00:02:41.691 --> 00:02:44.175
ONES WHERE HE WAS REALLY

00:02:44.186 --> 00:02:45.594
INTERACTING WITH, YOU KNOW, THE

00:02:45.627 --> 00:02:46.641
LOCALS.

00:02:46.652 --> 00:02:51.387
AND WAS IN AWE IN HIS APPROACH

00:02:51.422 --> 00:02:53.509
TO HIS DIFFICULT JOB.

00:02:53.511 --> 00:02:56.168
SO JUST, YOU KNOW, THAT VIDEO

00:02:56.179 --> 00:02:59.180
THAT YOU SAW AND HIS PICTURES

00:02:59.182 --> 00:03:01.989
AND HOW HE HANDLED IT PUT US AT

00:03:01.990 --> 00:03:03.385
EASE TO WHERE WE FELT LIKE HE’S

00:03:03.386 --> 00:03:04.323
ALL RIGHT.

00:03:04.334 --> 00:03:06.716
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WHAT IS SO BITTER

00:03:06.727 --> 00:03:08.909
ABOUT THIS IS HOW CHAOTIC IT

00:03:08.943 --> 00:03:09.679
WAS.

00:03:09.681 --> 00:03:12.023
IF THIS HAD BEEN HANDLED FROM

00:03:12.024 --> 00:03:13.853
BAGRAM AIR BASE WHICH THE U.S.

00:03:13.864 --> 00:03:15.931
CONTROLLED FOR 20 YEARS, THIS

00:03:15.942 --> 00:03:16.936
WOULDN’T HAVE HAPPENED.

00:03:16.970 --> 00:03:18.558
IS THAT YOUR VIEW?

00:03:18.569 --> 00:03:20.513
&gt;&gt; WELL, YEAH, I MEAN, THESE

00:03:20.524 --> 00:03:22.866
ARE, OF COURSE, MY VIEWS.

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:25.109
IT HAS NOTHING TO DO WITH HIS

00:03:25.110 --> 00:03:26.890
VIEW AS A MARINE.

00:03:26.901 --> 00:03:28.871
YOU KNOW, THE LOYALTY THAT HE

00:03:28.882 --> 00:03:30.223
HAS THERE.

00:03:30.234 --> 00:03:31.744
I NEVER SERVED.

00:03:31.755 --> 00:03:35.525
BUT YES, MY VIEW FROM WHAT I SAW

00:03:35.536 --> 00:03:38.009
OF THE AIRPORT THAT THEY’RE IN,

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.647
LOOKED LIKE A TURKEY SHOOT.

00:03:40.681 --> 00:03:42.796
IT’S FUNNELED IN TO A SINGLE

00:03:42.807 --> 00:03:45.263
FILE-TYPE ENTRY POINT AT WHICH

00:03:45.297 --> 00:03:48.196
IF YOU HAVE IN SORT OF CHAOS OF

00:03:48.207 --> 00:03:51.050
ANY SORT, THEY WOULD ALL LIKE

00:03:51.083 --> 00:03:53.627
GATHER TO THAT ONE FUNNELED

00:03:53.638 --> 00:03:55.936
AREA, WHICH THEY WOULD ALL BE

00:03:55.947 --> 00:03:56.240
ACCESSED.

00:03:56.251 --> 00:03:57.378
THAT’S WHAT HAPPENED.

00:03:57.412 --> 00:03:59.645
IT WAS JUST BASICALLY SO CHAOTIC

00:03:59.646 --> 00:04:01.909
AND NOT REALLY PLANNED OUT.

00:04:01.920 --> 00:04:05.625
NOW, I’M A CARPENTER AND I COULD

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:07.475
SPOT THAT WITH MY UNTRAINED

00:04:07.486 --> 00:04:08.715
MILITARY EYE.

00:04:08.726 --> 00:04:10.741
&gt;&gt; Tucker: YEAH, DID SEEM PRETTY

00:04:10.752 --> 00:04:11.194
OBVIOUS.

00:04:11.228 --> 00:04:13.214
HAVE YOU HEARD FROM THE MARINE

00:04:13.225 --> 00:04:15.062
CORPS, THE POLITICAL LEADERSHIP

00:04:15.073 --> 00:04:16.629
IN THIS COUNTRY SINCE YOUR SON’S

00:04:16.630 --> 00:04:17.295
DEATH?

00:04:17.296 --> 00:04:19.255
&gt;&gt; YEAH, THEY HAVE BEEN

00:04:19.266 --> 00:04:19.863
INCREDIBLE.

00:04:19.874 --> 00:04:22.217
SO YOU KNOW, BASICALLY WHAT HAD

00:04:22.228 --> 00:04:25.065
HAPPENED WAS HOW I FOUND OUT IS

00:04:25.076 --> 00:04:27.257
I WAS GLUED TO THE TV ALL DAY

00:04:27.268 --> 00:04:28.067
YESTERDAY.

00:04:28.078 --> 00:04:30.754
BECAUSE, YOU KNOW, I HAD WOKEN

00:04:30.765 --> 00:04:32.873
UP AND I WASN’T FEELING WELL.

00:04:32.884 --> 00:04:35.481
I FELT LIKE SOMETHING WAS WRONG.

00:04:35.514 --> 00:04:36.989
MY WIFE FELT THERE WAS SOMETHING

00:04:36.990 --> 00:04:37.489
WRONG.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:40.385
YOU KNOW, AS WE GO DOWN STAIRS,

00:04:40.387 --> 00:04:43.261
WE REALIZE THIS HAD HAPPENED.

00:04:43.263 --> 00:04:46.637
NOW, YOU KNOW, WE’RE LIKE, WELL,

00:04:46.648 --> 00:04:48.656
THERE’S SOME LEGITIMACY TO HOW

00:04:48.690 --> 00:04:50.104
WE’RE FEELING.

00:04:50.115 --> 00:04:53.091
SO WE’RE -- I’M GLUED TO THE TV

00:04:53.124 --> 00:04:54.049
ALL DAY.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:57.613
I HAVE MY -- AND I SEE IT SAYS

00:04:57.648 --> 00:05:01.320
THREE WOUNDED AND THREE KILLED

00:05:01.331 --> 00:05:04.221
AND TEN KILLED, THEN 12, THEN

00:05:04.232 --> 00:05:04.977
13.

00:05:04.979 --> 00:05:07.429
YOU KNOW, SO MANY AFGHANS.

00:05:07.430 --> 00:05:10.442
I’M TRYING TO FIND OUT WHAT TIME

00:05:10.453 --> 00:05:12.558
THIS ACTUALLY TOOK PLACE SO I

00:05:12.569 --> 00:05:14.767
CAN REFERENCE WHEN HE WAS

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:16.315
WORKING TO GET SOME SORT OF

00:05:16.326 --> 00:05:16.814
INSIGHT.

00:05:16.825 --> 00:05:19.657
THEN THEY SAID THE PRESIDENT WAS

00:05:19.668 --> 00:05:23.342
GOING TO TALK I BELIEVE AT 1:00.

00:05:23.353 --> 00:05:26.254
SO I FELT LIKE, YOU KNOW, MAYBE

00:05:26.287 --> 00:05:28.539
FROM THAT SPEECH I WOULD GET

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:30.891
WHETHER OR NOT ALL THE FAMILIES

00:05:30.893 --> 00:05:33.575
HAD BEEN CONTACTED OR IF THEY

00:05:33.577 --> 00:05:36.013
STILL HAD BEEN CONTACTED.

00:05:36.014 --> 00:05:38.575
PREVIOUSLY I HAD SEEN THAT, YOU

00:05:38.586 --> 00:05:40.593
KNOW, THE PRIOR ADMINISTRATION

00:05:40.604 --> 00:05:42.638
WOULD NORMALLY CONTACT PEOPLE

00:05:42.671 --> 00:05:43.465
LIKE FIRST.

00:05:43.476 --> 00:05:44.899
LIKE THE ACTUAL PRESIDENT OF THE

00:05:44.910 --> 00:05:45.568
UNITED STATES.

00:05:45.579 --> 00:05:47.859
SO I HAD SOME SORT OF SENSE LIKE

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:49.096
HEY, OKAY, MAYBE THAT WOULD

00:05:49.130 --> 00:05:49.660
HAPPEN.

00:05:49.661 --> 00:05:52.146
SO THEN THAT’S NOT HAPPENING.

00:05:52.147 --> 00:05:54.100
THINGS ARE STILL TRANSPIRING TO

00:05:54.111 --> 00:05:55.907
BE A LITTLE MORE GRAVE.

00:05:55.918 --> 00:05:57.615
I START GOOGLING.

00:05:57.616 --> 00:06:02.654
HOW LONG DOES IT TAKE FOR THE

00:06:02.665 --> 00:06:05.248
MILITARY TO, YOU KNOW,INFORM THE

00:06:05.259 --> 00:06:06.902
NEXT OF KIN?

00:06:06.935 --> 00:06:09.119
SOMEHOW FROM THE INTERNET I

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.326
GATHERED ABOUT EIGHT HOURS.

00:06:10.337 --> 00:06:12.741
THIS IS ABOUT AFTER HE TALKED.

00:06:12.775 --> 00:06:14.310
AFTER HE TALKED HE SAID, YOU

00:06:14.311 --> 00:06:16.656
KNOW, I BELIEVE HE HAD SAID

00:06:16.667 --> 00:06:17.905
THEY’RE STILL GOING TO BE

00:06:17.939 --> 00:06:19.876
CONTACTED OR I THINK MAYBE THE

00:06:19.877 --> 00:06:21.560
COMMENTATOR SAID THERE WILL BE

00:06:21.571 --> 00:06:23.108
SOME KNOCK ON THE DOORS TONIGHT.

00:06:23.119 --> 00:06:25.600
I DIDN’T KNOW IF THERE WOULD BE

00:06:25.611 --> 00:06:28.065
A KNOCK ON THE DOOR OR CALL.

00:06:28.099 --> 00:06:30.547
SO AFTER HIS SPEECH THAT HE DID,

00:06:30.558 --> 00:06:32.848
I THEN GOT MY PHONE AND PUT MY

00:06:32.882 --> 00:06:34.622
PHONE DOWN BY THE TELEVISION.

00:06:34.633 --> 00:06:37.113
NOW I HAD THE CABLE ON THAT HAD

00:06:37.124 --> 00:06:38.707
THE FOUR DIFFERENT NETWORKS ON

00:06:38.718 --> 00:06:40.303
MY CABLE.

00:06:40.314 --> 00:06:43.750
I HAD FOX NEWS, BBC, CNN AND

00:06:43.751 --> 00:06:44.471
SOMETHING ELSE.

00:06:44.482 --> 00:06:47.391
I WAS JUST -- THE REASON I HAD

00:06:47.402 --> 00:06:49.581
THAT SO I COULD SEE THE OPTICS

00:06:49.614 --> 00:06:51.516
OF THE FOUR CHANNELS AND PICK

00:06:51.527 --> 00:06:52.775
ONE I WANTED TO GET MY

00:06:52.809 --> 00:06:53.852
INFORMATION FROM.

00:06:53.854 --> 00:06:56.008
WELL, I ALSO STARTED TO THINK,

00:06:56.019 --> 00:06:57.205
YOU KNOW, THEY MIGHT POSSIBLY

00:06:57.216 --> 00:06:57.908
COME HERE.

00:06:57.919 --> 00:07:00.208
SO WHAT I HAD DONE, I GOT MY

00:07:00.219 --> 00:07:02.081
PHONE THAT HAS THE CAMERA AT THE

00:07:02.092 --> 00:07:04.438
FRONT PORCH AND I PUT THAT DOWN.

00:07:04.449 --> 00:07:07.230
SO IF ANYBODY WAS TO WALK UP, I

00:07:07.263 --> 00:07:08.325
COULD RUSH OUTSIDE AND INTERCEPT

00:07:08.327 --> 00:07:08.727
THEM.

00:07:08.738 --> 00:07:10.893
I DIDN’T WANT IF SOMETHING

00:07:10.904 --> 00:07:12.729
HAPPENS TO MY SON THAT THESE

00:07:12.762 --> 00:07:14.339
MARINES -- NOTHING AGAINST

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:17.290
THEM -- WOULD TELL MY FAMILY.

00:07:17.301 --> 00:07:19.300
I FELT LIKE THAT WAS MY

00:07:19.311 --> 00:07:19.967
RESPONSIBILITY.

00:07:19.978 --> 00:07:21.928
SO I FINALLY REALIZED THEY’RE

00:07:21.939 --> 00:07:24.416
NOT GOING TO COME AT 3:00.

00:07:24.451 --> 00:07:26.346
THEY’RE GOING TO COME BETWEEN

00:07:26.347 --> 00:07:27.808
5:00 AND 10:00 WHEN EVERYBODY IS

00:07:27.819 --> 00:07:29.974
HOME FROM WORK.

00:07:29.975 --> 00:07:32.602
SO I REALIZED, YOU KNOW, 5:00 TO

00:07:32.603 --> 00:07:33.150
10:00.

00:07:33.161 --> 00:07:36.812
IF I CAN MAKE IT, EVEN IF I

00:07:36.823 --> 00:07:38.707
HAVEN’T HEARD FROM HIM, I KNOW

00:07:38.718 --> 00:07:40.717
HE’S ALL RIGHT AND HE DOESN’T

00:07:40.728 --> 00:07:42.846
HAVE A WAY TO CONTACT ME BECAUSE

00:07:42.857 --> 00:07:45.391
THEY SHUT DOWN INTERNET OR CELL

00:07:45.402 --> 00:07:46.687
SERVICE OR WHATEVER.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:48.470
7:15, I SEE SOMETHING IN THE

00:07:48.481 --> 00:07:51.057
CORNER OF MY EYE ON MY PHONE.

00:07:51.068 --> 00:07:52.420
THREE PEOPLE ARE WALKING UP MY

00:07:52.431 --> 00:07:52.915
DRIVEWAY.

00:07:52.926 --> 00:07:55.909
MY OTHER SON, HIS BROTHER, HAD

00:07:55.942 --> 00:07:57.921
GONE TO A FOOTBALL GAME AND HAD

00:07:57.932 --> 00:07:58.983
TWO FRIENDS.

00:07:58.994 --> 00:08:01.513
I WAS HOPING THAT IT WAS HIM.

00:08:01.548 --> 00:08:05.771
AS SOON AS I SAW THEM TURN THE

00:08:05.772 --> 00:08:10.062
CORNER, THREE MARINE SUITS, MY

00:08:10.073 --> 00:08:11.745
LIFE CHANGED FOREVER.

00:08:11.779 --> 00:08:14.227
I WENT DOWN THERE AND MET THEM.

00:08:14.238 --> 00:08:16.091
I THINK I DID BEFORE THEY EVEN

00:08:16.102 --> 00:08:17.283
KNOCKED ON THE DOOR.

00:08:17.294 --> 00:08:20.032
ALL I KEPT SAYING -- THIS GOES

00:08:20.066 --> 00:08:22.105
TO THE POINT THAT YOU’RE ASKING.

00:08:22.116 --> 00:08:24.214
DID ANY SERVICE COME AND ADDRESS

00:08:24.225 --> 00:08:24.692
TO US.

00:08:24.726 --> 00:08:25.620
YES.

00:08:25.622 --> 00:08:28.470
AND THEY WERE INCREDIBLE.

00:08:28.481 --> 00:08:32.497
THESE YOUNG MEN WERE SO -- HAD

00:08:32.531 --> 00:08:35.524
SO MUCH EMPATHY AND SO CONCERNED

00:08:35.525 --> 00:08:37.819
WITH ME AND MY FAMILY WHO

00:08:37.830 --> 00:08:38.888
LUCKILY MY FAMILY WASN’T THERE.

00:08:38.922 --> 00:08:41.779
IT WAS ME AT THE TIME.

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:43.800
I THANK GOD, YOU KNOW, I THANK

00:08:43.801 --> 00:08:45.765
JESUS THAT THAT HAPPENED, THAT I

00:08:45.776 --> 00:08:47.769
WAS ABLE TO INTERCEPT THEM.

00:08:47.771 --> 00:08:49.183
THEY WERE THERE FOR LIKE FIVE

00:08:49.217 --> 00:08:49.779
MINUTES.

00:08:49.781 --> 00:08:51.897
I WAS LIKE LET’S SIGN WHATEVER

00:08:51.908 --> 00:08:53.539
PAPERS WE HAVE TO SIGN NOW.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.556
BUT YOU HAVE TO LEAVE BECAUSE I

00:08:55.567 --> 00:08:57.230
HAVE TO TAKE CARE OF MY FAMILY

00:08:57.241 --> 00:08:59.082
AND I DON’T WANT SOMEONE TO COME

00:08:59.083 --> 00:09:00.302
WHILE YOU’RE HERE.

00:09:00.336 --> 00:09:01.363
THEY WERE TOTALLY

00:09:01.374 --> 00:09:01.802
UNDERSTANDABLE.

00:09:01.813 --> 00:09:05.638
IT DAWNED ON ME THAT YES, MAYBE

00:09:05.649 --> 00:09:07.493
I DON’T NEED THE CONDOLENCES

00:09:07.504 --> 00:09:09.650
FROM THEM BUT I DON’T WANT TO --

00:09:09.684 --> 00:09:12.032
I DON’T WANT TO TAKE THAT

00:09:12.043 --> 00:09:13.209
OPPORTUNITY FROM MY OTHER FAMILY

00:09:13.242 --> 00:09:14.081
MEMBERS.

00:09:14.082 --> 00:09:16.159
MY WIFE, MY SON.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:19.680
SO I ASKED THEM, LOOK THEY’RE AT

00:09:19.691 --> 00:09:21.488
A FOOTBALL GAME FOR THE HIGH

00:09:21.499 --> 00:09:22.300
SCHOOL, WATCHING A FOOTBALL

00:09:22.301 --> 00:09:22.692
GAME.

00:09:22.693 --> 00:09:24.674
CAN YOU WAIT DOWN THE STREET

00:09:24.675 --> 00:09:25.763
UNTIL THEY COME?

00:09:25.774 --> 00:09:30.195
I CAN SEE IF THEY WANT YOU TO

00:09:30.229 --> 00:09:31.869
COME AND DO YOUR CONDOLENCES

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:32.402
PRESENTATION.

00:09:32.413 --> 00:09:35.042
THOSE BOYS SAT OUT THERE FOR

00:09:35.076 --> 00:09:36.148
FOUR HOURS.

00:09:36.159 --> 00:09:38.518
FOR FOUR HOURS THEY SAT OUT

00:09:38.529 --> 00:09:41.502
THERE UNTIL THEY CAME.

00:09:41.513 --> 00:09:44.414
UNTIL MY WIFE CAME, WHICH SHE --

00:09:44.425 --> 00:09:46.381
IT WAS NOT GOOD.

00:09:46.415 --> 00:09:48.341
I COULD NOT HAVE THEM COME TO

00:09:48.352 --> 00:09:49.338
